  </p>

  <h2 id="salary-reality">Salary reality by path, not by forum screenshots</h2>

  <p>
    Every one of these paths has a viral "I earn X lakhs" story attached to it somewhere online. Compare
    the real, sourced ranges instead.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
